  - cn: "\u55E8\uFF0C\u4F60\u6765\u4E86\u3002"
    en: Hi. You're here.
    cnHaveBranch: 0
    cnBranch: []
    enHaveBranch: 0
    enBranch: []
    isPlayerTalking: 0
    isAside: 0
    codes: 
    onlyCode: 0
    speaker: 1
    expression: 1
    showCg: 0
    cgNum: 0
    minigameType: 0
  - cn: "\u7B2C\u4E00\u5929\u5F53\u961F\u957F\u7684\u611F\u89C9\u8FD8\u597D\u5417\uFF1F"
    en: How did it feel to be captain on the first day?
    cnHaveBranch: 0
    cnBranch: []
    enHaveBranch: 0
    enBranch: []
    isPlayerTalking: 0
    isAside: 0
    codes: 
    onlyCode: 0
    speaker: 1
    expression: 5
    showCg: 0
    cgNum: 0
    minigameType: 0
  - cn: "\u6211\u4E0D\u5E0C\u671B\u7ED9\u4F60\u592A\u5927\u7684\u538B\u529B\uFF0C\u4F46\u4F60\u53EF\u80FD\u786E\u5B9E\u662F\u6211\u4EEC\u4E4B\u4E2D\u6700\u9002\u5408\u6210\u4E3A\u9886\u8896\u7684\u4EBA\u3002"
    en: I do not want to put too much pressure on you, but you may really be the
      most suitable person among us to become the leader.
    cnHaveBranch: 0
    cnBranch: []
    enHaveBranch: 0
    enBranch: []
    isPlayerTalking: 0
    isAside: 0
    codes: 
    onlyCode: 0
    speaker: 1
    expression: 5
    showCg: 0
    cgNum: 0
    minigameType: 0
  - cn: "\u6211\u5F88\u9AD8\u5174\u4F60\u613F\u610F\u544A\u8BC9\u5927\u5BB6\u90A3\u4EF6\u4E8B\uFF0C\u800C\u4E0D\u662F\u628A\u6240\u6709\u4EBA\u90FD\u7792\u5728\u9F13\u91CC\u3002"
    en: I am glad you were willing to tell everyone about that matter instead of
      keeping all of us in the dark.
    cnHaveBranch: 0
    cnBranch: []
    enHaveBranch: 0
    enBranch: []
    isPlayerTalking: 0
    isAside: 0
    codes: 
    onlyCode: 0
    speaker: 1
    expression: 5
    showCg: 0
    cgNum: 0
    minigameType: 0
  - cn: "\u4F60\u662F\u6307\u6211\u4EEC\u7684\u98DF\u7269\u4E0D\u591A\u4E86\uFF1F"
    en: You mean the fact that we do not have much food left?
    cnHaveBranch: 0
    cnBranch: []
    enHaveBranch: 0
    enBranch: []
    isPlayerTalking: 1
    isAside: 0
    codes: 
    onlyCode: 0
    speaker: 1
    expression: 5
    showCg: 0
    cgNum: 0
    minigameType: 0
  - cn: "\u6CA1\u9519\uFF0C\u867D\u7136\u5F88\u96BE\u63A5\u53D7\uFF0C\u4F46\u603B\u597D\u8FC7\u4E00\u65E0\u6240\u77E5\u5730\u6B7B\u3002"
    en: Exactly. It is hard to accept, but it is still better than dying without
      knowing anything.
    cnHaveBranch: 0
    cnBranch: []
    enHaveBranch: 0
    enBranch: []
    isPlayerTalking: 0
    isAside: 0
    codes: 
    onlyCode: 0
    speaker: 1
    expression: 3
    showCg: 0
    cgNum: 0
    minigameType: 0
  - cn: "\u8FD9\u600E\u4E48\u4E0D\u7B97\u4E00\u79CD\u6B3A\u9A97\u5462\uFF0C\u8BA9\u6211\u4EEC\u59CB\u7EC8\u4E0D\u5FC5\u4E3A\u8FD9\u6837\u7684\u75DB\u82E6\u6240\u70E6\u607C\u3002"
    en: How is that not also a kind of deception, though? To let us never have to
      worry about that kind of pain.
    cnHaveBranch: 0
    cnBranch: []
    enHaveBranch: 0
    enBranch: []
    isPlayerTalking: 0
    isAside: 0
    codes: 
    onlyCode: 0
    speaker: 1
    expression: 3
    showCg: 0
    cgNum: 0
    minigameType: 0
  - cn: "\u4E9A\u6469\u65AF\u6709\u81EA\u5DF1\u7684\u8003\u8651\uFF0C\u6211\u4E5F\u662F\u3002"
    en: Amos had his own reasons. So do I.
    cnHaveBranch: 0
    cnBranch: []
    enHaveBranch: 0
    enBranch: []
    isPlayerTalking: 1
    isAside: 0
    codes: 
    onlyCode: 0
    speaker: 1
    expression: 3
    showCg: 0
    cgNum: 0
    minigameType: 0
  - cn: "\u2026\u2026\u4F60\u4EEC\u90FD\u662F\u5BF9\u7684\u3002"
    en: ...You are both right.
    cnHaveBranch: 0
    cnBranch: []
    enHaveBranch: 0
    enBranch: []
    isPlayerTalking: 0
    isAside: 0
    codes: 
    onlyCode: 0
    speaker: 1
